InsightFace 0.7.3
=================

This directory vendors the complete Python package and package data from the
InsightFace 0.7.3 PyPI source distribution:

  https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/0b/8d/0f4af90999ca96cf8cb846eb5ae27c5ef5b390f9c090dd19e4fa76364c13/insightface-0.7.3.tar.gz
  SHA-256: f191f719612ebb37018f41936814500544cd0f86e6fcd676c023f354c668ddf7

The corresponding upstream release commit is
668e8d474267bdd2c9769c2cbbab3fe4d1db15a6. InsightFace is authored by the
InsightFace contributors. The bundled face3d sources identify Yao Feng as
their author. The upstream project distributes this code under the MIT License;
see LICENSE in this directory.

Ayase packaging adaptation: insightface/app/__init__.py imports MaskRenderer
only when that optional symbol is requested. This keeps FaceAnalysis and the
complete model-zoo graph importable without compiling the unused face3d Cython
renderer. All other upstream package code and data are retained byte-for-byte.
Upstream build metadata, generated egg-info, and README.md are not runtime
package contents and are not included in this vendored package directory.

No pretrained model weights are included here. InsightFace's upstream notice
states that pretrained models supplied by the project, including automatically
and manually downloaded models, are available for non-commercial research
purposes only. Model users must comply with the applicable model license.
